<%- include('../partials/head') %>

<main class="about-page-main" style="padding: var(--space-12) 0 var(--space-20);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 840px;">
    
    <div class="about-masthead-kicker">
      <span>INSTITUTIONAL STATEMENT</span>
      <span class="about-kicker-sep">•</span>
      <span>ESTABLISHED 2026</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="about-title">
      Understanding the ideas behind how we think, feel, and behave.
    </h1>

    <div class="article-prose">
      <p class="about-lead">
        <strong>EUREKA</strong> is an independent digital journal investigating cognitive psychology, behavioral decision systems, mental models, and the evolutionary habits that govern everyday human interaction.
      </p>

      <p>
        Too much modern discourse surrounding human psychology relies on viral catchphrases, algorithmic drama, and pseudoscientific shortcuts. EUREKA was conceived as an intellectual sanctuary: a platform where rigorous scientific inquiry meets thoughtful, distraction-free editorial prose.
      </p>

      <blockquote>
        "You can understand why you feel attached without allowing the feeling to decide what is healthy for you."
      </blockquote>

      <!-- OFFICIAL INSTAGRAM CHANNEL CALLOUT -->
      <div class="about-ig-card">
        <div class="about-ig-card-inner">
          <div class="about-ig-icon">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"></rect>
              <path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"></path>
              <line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="about-ig-text">
            <h3>Visual Science on Instagram: @eureka.discoveries</h3>
            <p>
              In addition to our long-form essays, we publish daily infographics, mental model diagrams, and cognitive bias breakdowns on our official channel.
            </p>
            <a href="<%= siteConfig.instagramUrl %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-primary" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-top: 8px;">
              Follow @eureka.discoveries on Instagram ↗
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 id="disciplines">Core Disciplines & Research Axes</h2>
      <div class="disciplines-grid">
        <div class="discipline-card">
          <h4>Cognitive Psychology</h4>
          <p>Heuristics, memory encoding, perceptual filters, cognitive biases, and executive decision-making.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="discipline-card">
          <h4>Attachment & Relational Systems</h4>
          <p>Attachment dynamics, communication fidelity, emotional boundaries, and compatibility matrices.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="discipline-card">
          <h4>Behavioral Reinforcement</h4>
          <p>Habit feedback loops, motivation architectures, dopamine regulation, and social incentives.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="discipline-card">
          <h4>Consciousness & Identity</h4>
          <p>Self-concept formulation, attention span economics, and introspective awareness.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="discipline-card">
          <h4>Physical & Quantum Sciences</h4>
          <p>Conceptual translations of physics, quantum mechanics, and empirical sciences into accessible mental models.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="discipline-card">
          <h4>Philosophy of Human Nature</h4>
          <p>Ethics, existential inquiries, epistemology, and historical models of civilization and thought.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr />

      <h2 id="editorial">Editorial Masthead & Technical Provenance</h2>
      <div class="about-credits-grid">
        <div class="about-credit-card">
          <div class="about-credit-name">Kulbhushan Pohare</div>
          <div class="about-credit-role">Full-Stack Platform Architect</div>
          <p class="about-credit-bio">
            Engineered the EUREKA publication using a robust, custom Node.js & Express server architecture, zero-dependency editorial styling, fast server-side rendering, and privacy-first reader interactions.
          </p>
          <div class="about-credit-contact">
            Location: Nagpur & Nanded, Maharashtra • 
            <a href="mailto:poharekulbhushan2006@gmail.com">poharekulbhushan2006@gmail.com</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-credit-card">
          <div class="about-credit-name">Antara Morankar</div>
          <div class="about-credit-role">Research Director & Lead Essayist</div>
          <p class="about-credit-bio">
            Directs scientific research synthesis, psychological literature reviews, and authored the flagship essays on attachment theory and relational psychology.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 id="standards">Contributing & Writing</h2>
      <p>
        Have a psychological insight, behavioral model, or scientific essay to submit? You can format and preview your draft directly in <a href="/editor" style="color: var(--color-accent); text-decoration: underline;">Eureka Studio</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<%- include('../partials/scripts') %>
